Gemini 3.5 Flash must be used for:

* market-theme/event discovery;
* enterprise web evidence retrieval;
* Trigger-2 exact-event evidence retrieval.

Claude Opus 4.6 must be used for:

* Trigger-1 final eight-section refinement;
* Trigger-2 final eight-section refinement;
* Step 2.1 scenario generation;
* Step 2.3 event-driven risk-factor generation;
* deep feedback reasoning when material.

Claude Sonnet 4.6 may be used for:

* theme-quality assessment;
* lighter context assessment;
* normal feedback interpretation;
