```

6. display actual technical errors rather than pretending zero events were successfully found;
7. log only models actually triggered.

The intended call from `runScan()` is:

```javascript
const data = await apiPost('/api/v1/rpr/market-events/fetch', {
  themes: themes.map(t => t.name || t.narr),
  theme_inputs: themes.map(t => ({
    theme: t.name || t.narr,
    description: t.narr || ''
  })),
  max_events_per_theme: 3
}, TOUT.SCAN);
```

